---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - CryptoNav">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-6">About CryptoNav</h1>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>CryptoNav</strong> is a comprehensive crypto navigation site for global users. Our mission is to bring quality crypto resources scattered across the web into one place, helping users quickly discover, filter, and access exchanges, wallets, market tools, DeFi, NFTs, and more.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mt-6 mb-2">What Makes Us Different</h2>
      <ul class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
        <li><strong>Human Review</strong>: Every listed project is reviewed to ensure it has a real product or service</li>
        <li><strong>Clear Categories</strong>: 9-category system to quickly find what you need</li>
        <li><strong>Live Prices</strong>: Homepage ticker showing real-time prices of top coins</li>
        <li><strong>Safety Labels</strong>: Audited projects are flagged to help you spot risk</li>
        <li><strong>Dark Mode</strong>: Day/night toggle to protect your eyes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mt-6 mb-2">Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        This site provides information navigation services only and does not constitute investment advice. Crypto investments carry high risk — please do your own research (DYOR) and take full responsibility for your decisions. We make no guarantees about the safety or profitability of any project.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mt-6 mb-2">Contact Us</h2>
      <div class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 space-y-1">
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@cryptonav.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">hello@cryptonav.com</a></p>
        <p>Submit a project: <a href="/submit" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Submit Project</a></p>
        <p>Partnership & sponsorship: <a href="mailto:advertise@cryptonav.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">advertise@cryptonav.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
